{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120165","id":3842561674,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7lCNaK","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120165","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120165.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120165.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120165","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120165/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120165/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120165/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ae00eb4e1c9123986166aa6c6cc22a5f71bae930","number":120165,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix volumetric fog corner misalignment due to incorrect near frustum size","user":{"login":"williamdev06","id":135645566,"node_id":"U_kgDOCBXJfg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135645566?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06","html_url":"https://github.com/williamdev06","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamdev06/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"For perspective projections, fog_near_size was set to the frustum half-extents at z_near, but the GLSL shader maps fog_unit_pos.z = 0 to view_pos.z = 0 (the camera origin). This mismatch caused the mix() in the shader to apply a spurious offset proportional to NDC position, which is zero at the screen center but maximally visible at the corners.\r\n\r\nOrthographic projection is unaffected as it retains fog_near_size = fog_far_size.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Would fix an underlying issue with how the volumetric fog is implemented. Where by, due to a mismatch between fog_frustrum_size_begin and how it maps onto the fog shader causes a misalignment of the volumetric fog at the corners of the screen. The issue itself isn't that massive but keen eyes will see it immediately.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n\r\nThis PR does not fix the additional issue of Stereo Volumetric Fog for VR\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering"